{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>本港周六（27日）大致天晴，早上市區最低氣溫約19°C，新界再低幾度。日間非常乾燥，最高氣溫約26°C。吹微風，晚間轉吹和緩北至東北風，離岸風勢間中清勁，高地達強風程度。展望隨後兩三日大致天晴，下周日（28日）風勢頗大，下周中後期日間相當溫暖。（天文台）<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:34:51.120841+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":127,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:33:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T21:37:48.770837+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:24.226770+00:00","content_hash":"198ea9ccf7d14eecb2f3b1dca4b50de7488848ffbc142245956f0f8ee31ff5c3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}